    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The beginning of the Chibanian is the Brunhes–Matuyama reversal, when the Earth's magnetic field last underwent reversal. It ends with the onset of the Eemian interglacial period (Marine Isotope Stage 5). https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chibanian</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">older bound -0.774 Ma</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">younger bound -0.129 Ma</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Chibanian Age</rdfs:label>
