    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The base of the Chibanian Stage of the Middle Pleistocene Subseries is defined at 1.1 m below the directional midpoint of the Matuyama-Brunhes reversal at the base of a regional lithostratigraphic marker, the Byk-E tephra bed in the Chiba Section, Chiba Prefecture, Japan</rdfs:comment>
