    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">RDF/OWL representation of the 2012-08 edition of the International Chronostratigraphic Chart from the International Commission on Stratigraphy. Encoded using OWL implementation from GSO. Adapted from Cox&amp;Richard OWL GeologicTime ontology</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">dc:source  Cohen, K.M., Finney, S.C., Gibbard, P.L. &amp; Fan, J.-X. (2013; updated) The ICS  International  Chronostratigraphic Chart. Episodes 36: 199-204.</rdfs:comment>
