    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Inverse relation to inheresIn - directed relation between a carrier and the inherant it carries. E.g. between a rock body and a thickness.</rdfs:comment>
