  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://w3id.org/gso/1.0/common/contains">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <dct:source xml:lang="en">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DE-9IM. Based on the seminal works of Egenhofer et al. (1990, 1991),  Cohn et al. (1997), Clementini et al. (1993, 1994).</dct:source>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Object region lies in subject region, and the interiors intersect. Another definition: "subject region contains object region  iff no points of object region lie in the exterior of subject region, and at least one point of the interior of object region lies in the interior of subject region".</rdfs:comment>
