    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A relation between a non-abstact particular and a spatial or temoral location value - still in a test stage; intended as a short-cut for specifying the spatial or temporal location of something, but therefore equal to saying that something occupies space or time (in/directly) and has a spatial/temporal location quality with a certain  value (in a spatial / temporal reference system). Generically depends on the spatial or temporal value.</rdfs:comment>
